 consolidated revenue climbed 41.5% to OMR 241.5M.","Successfully completed scheduled major turnaround maintenance of its LPG plant in February 2026 while maintaining strong EBITDA of OMR 98.2M.","FY2025 Financial Snapshot: Revenue of OMR 225.97M and Net Profit of OMR 47.68M (Total Assets: OMR 804.53M).","Ownership Registry (mcd.om): 16,848 registered shareholders • Omani 88.8% | GCC 9.4% | Foreign & Arab 1.9% (2 disclosed 5%+ holders)."],"segments":[{"name":"Methanol Integrated Plant","pct":73.9,"summary":"Parent-company Salalah complex manufacturing and exporting methanol and ammonia products, generating OMR 178.5M in 9M 2026.","color":"bg-indigo-500"},{"name":"LPG Plant (OQ LPG)","pct":26.1,"summary":"Subsidiary gas-extraction facility producing and supplying LPG to both export (OMR 53.4M) and local Oman (OMR 9.6M) markets.","color":"bg-cyan-400"}],"segmentMode":"verified_pct","segmentNote":"9M 2026 Segment Revenue Mix (IFRS 8, Note 25, Unaudited)","series":{"dates":["Nov 23, '25","Nov 24, '25","Nov 25, '25","Nov 30, '25","Dec 01, '25","Dec 02, '25","Dec 03, '25","Dec 04, '25","Dec 07, '25","Dec 08, '25","Dec 09, '25","Dec 10, '25","Dec 11, '25","Dec 14, '25","Dec 15, '25","Dec 16, '25","Dec 17, '25","Dec 18, '25","Dec 21, '25","Dec 22, '25","Dec 23, '25","Dec 24, '25","Dec 25, '25","Dec 28, '25","Dec 29, '25","Dec 30, '25","Dec 31, '25","Jan 01, '26","Jan 04, '26","Jan 05, '26","Jan 06, '26","Jan 07, '26","Jan 08, '26","Jan 11, '26","Jan 12, '26","Jan 13, '26","Jan 14, '26","Jan 19, '26","Jan 20, '26","Jan 21, '26","Jan 22, '26","Jan 25, '26","Jan 26, '26","Jan 27, '26","Jan 28, '26","Jan 29, '26","Feb 01, '26","Feb 02, '26","Feb 03, '26","Feb 04, '26","Feb 05, '26","Feb 08, '26","Feb 09, '26","Feb 10, '26","Feb 11, '26","Feb 12, '26","Feb 15, '26","Feb 16, '26","Feb 17, '26","Feb 18, '26","Feb 19, '26","Feb 22, '26","Feb 23, '26","Feb 24, '26","Feb 25, '26","Feb 26, '26","Mar 01, '26","Mar 02, '26","Mar 03, '26","Mar 04, '26","Mar 05, '26","Mar 08, '26","Mar 09